          "response_id": "56b1ca86-ad62-4fc3-b046-1aa7fed890bf",
          "answer": "There is no single objectively “best” incentive travel company for corporate events in Spain, but the strongest candidates in the results are **Meridional Events**, **NUBA Incoming Spain**, **Crossover Events**, **Tuset DMC**, and **Ovation DMC** because each explicitly positions itself as a Spain-focused DMC or event agency for **corporate events, incentives, meetings, and conferences**.[2][3][8][14][6][1]\n\nIf you want the most directly relevant options from the results:\n\n- **Meridional Events** — describes itself as a trusted DMC in Spain for **corporate events, incentive travel, conferences, business meetings, and retreats**.[2]\n- **NUBA Incoming Spain** — presents itself as a premier DMC organizing **incentive trips and corporate events across Spain and Portugal**.[14]\n- **Crossover Events** — says it handles **team building, incentive trips, and international conferences** in Spain and Portugal.[6][15]\n- **Tuset DMC** — offers **incentive travel in Spain** and has offices in **Barcelona, Madrid, and Valencia**, which suggests broad on-the-ground coverage.[1]\n- **Ovation DMC** — markets Spain DMC services for **corporate events, incentive travel, and MICE** with offices in Madrid and Barcelona.[8]\n\nIf you need a practical recommendation, I would shortlist like this:\n\n- **Best all-around Spain specialist:** **Meridional Events**[2][3]\n- **Best for premium bespoke programs:** **NUBA Incoming Spain**[14]\n- **Best for multi-city coverage and local presence:** **Tuset DMC**[1]\n- **Best for event-led incentive experiences:** **Crossover Events**[6][15]\n- **Best for established DMC structure in Spain:** **Ovation DMC**[8]\n\nIf you want, I can also rank these by **luxury level, budget-friendliness, or city coverage** for Barcelona, Madrid, Valencia, or Ibiza."
