          "response_id": "0ba8bed1-d0ce-4eb3-9355-d28b68e3d7c5",
          "answer": "A strong choice for an international company’s incentive trip in Spain is **Meridional Events**, which presents itself as a trusted **DMC in Spain** for corporate events, incentive travel, conferences, meetings, and company retreats nationwide.[1] If you want a broader Spain-wide operator with multiple office bases and dedicated incentive-travel services, **Tuset DMC** is another solid option, with offices in **Barcelona, Madrid, and Valencia**.[6][19]\n\nIf you want a quick shortlist, I’d consider these by use case:\n\n- **Meridional Events** — good for all-around Spain incentive programmes and multi-city coordination.[1]\n- **Tuset DMC** — useful if you want strong on-the-ground coverage in **Barcelona, Madrid, and Valencia**.[6][19]\n- **NUBA Incoming Spain** — positioned for **bespoke travel experiences** and world-class incentive trips across Spain and Portugal.[13]\n- **Liberty International** — a broader MICE/incentive operator with Spain-specific programme support.[4]\n- **Indigo DMC Group** — focused on incentive travel in Spain and established in the market for more than 20 years.[8]\n\nIf your incentive trip is concentrated in a specific destination, the best fit from the results is:\n\n- **Mallorca / Balearics**: **Lifexperiences** or **Meridional Events**.[5][15]\n- **Barcelona / Madrid / Valencia**: **Tuset DMC**.[6][19]\n- **Costa del Sol / Málaga**: **Indigo DMC** or **Meridional Events**.[10][12]\n\nIf you want, I can also narrow this down to the **best 3 DMCs** based on your trip size, budget, and preferred city in Spain."
